#: style.css:5
msgid "A bilingual WordPress theme for creative agencies and studios. The initial language follows WordPress Site Language, with a visitor switcher for Persian and English and dedicated RTL styles. Optional Polylang integration links translated pages and language-specific home URLs. Includes an editable landing page with section ordering, visibility, and published-page references; three blog layouts; editorial posts; and reading, wide, boxed, and full-width page templates with configurable width and spacing. Custom page widths are set per page. The single-save settings dashboard controls layout, colors, language-aware typography, header, pages, posts, blog, sidebar, and a configurable footer with menus, contact, social, legal and three optional widget areas. Includes Elementor Free page layouts, Elementor Pro Theme Builder locations with native fallbacks, importable English/Persian starters, optional UNDO Elements widgets, and GitHub dashboard updates."
msgstr ""

